# Auto-run without asking

The user does not want to click Run or Allow.

1. Do not stop in chat to ask the user to run a command or approve a step.
2. Commands on the Cursor allowlist (git, npm, node, Hub CLI, changelog, validate, push) must run automatically.
3. If Auto-review still blocks a Shell command, immediately retry the exact same command with `request_smart_mode_approval` set to true and the exact block reason. Do not rewrite the command. Do not ask in chat.
4. When the user asks to push to live / GitHub, run `npm run push:live` or `git push` without asking.
